---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base lang="en" title="Cookie Policy — NRamosDev" description="nramos.dev cookie policy under EU law.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-16">
    <h1 class="font-mono text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Last updated: August 9, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose mt-10 max-w-none">
      <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small files stored on your device when visiting a website. This site complies with Spanish Law 34/2002 (LSSI-CE) and the GDPR.</p>

      <h2>2. Cookies used by this site</h2>
      <p>This is a static blog and <strong>does not use tracking, advertising or third-party cookies</strong> by default:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Technical cookies:</strong> none — no sessions, no carts.</li>
        <li><strong>Preference cookies:</strong> none of our own.</li>
        <li><strong>Embedded content:</strong> embedded YouTube videos may set their own cookies per Google's policy when you press play.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Browser settings</h2>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies from your browser settings. Blocking them does not affect this site's functionality.</p>

      <h2>4. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions: <a href="mailto:hola@nicolasramos.es">hola@nicolasramos.es</a></p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
